#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:516
msgid "Watch the tutorial on YouTube"
msgstr "Zum Tutorial auf YouTube"

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:556
msgid "Global Options"
msgstr "Globale Optionen"

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:559
#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:561
msgid "Do not track administrators"
msgstr "Administratoren nicht tracken"

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:562
msgid "Recommended: logged-in administrators trigger neither pixel nor server events."
msgstr "Empfohlen: Eingeloggte Administratoren lösen weder Pixel- noch Server-Events aus."

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:566
msgid "Automatic cookie banner detection (GDPR)"
msgstr "Automatische Cookie-Banner-Erkennung (DSGVO)"

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:568
msgid "Enable automatic cookie banner detection"
msgstr "Automatische Cookie-Banner-Erkennung aktivieren"

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:569
msgid "Automatically detects installed cookie banners and blocks browser and CAPI events until consent is given. Supports Must Have Plugins Cookie Bar, Borlabs Cookie, Complianz, Real Cookie Banner, CookieYes, Cookiebot, SureCookies and any banner using the WP Consent API. Automatic blocking cannot be guaranteed for unlisted third-party banners. Sites without a cookie banner are never blocked."
msgstr "Erkennt installierte Cookie-Banner automatisch und blockiert Browser- und CAPI-Events bis zur Einwilligung. Unterstützt u. a. Must Have Plugins Cookie Bar, Borlabs Cookie, Complianz, Real Cookie Banner, CookieYes, Cookiebot, SureCookies sowie alle Banner mit WP Consent API. Bei nicht gelisteten Drittanbieter-Bannern kann die automatische Blockierung nicht garantiert werden. Websites ohne Cookie-Banner werden niemals blockiert."

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:574
#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:709
#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:854
msgid "Platforms"
msgstr "Plattformen"

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:576
msgid "Meta (Facebook)"
msgstr "Meta (Facebook)"

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:576
msgid "Enable Meta tracking"
msgstr "Meta-Tracking aktivieren"

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:580
msgid "Meta Pixel ID"
msgstr "Meta Pixel ID"

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:581
msgid "Meta Events Manager → Data sources → your pixel → copy the ID shown below its name."
msgstr "Meta Events Manager → Datenquellen → Dein Pixel → ID unter dem Namen kopieren."

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:590
#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:592
msgid "Enable Conversions API"
msgstr "Conversions API aktivieren"

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:593
msgid "Additionally sends matched events to Meta server-side – deduplicated via the same event ID as in the browser."
msgstr "Sendet gematchte Events zusätzlich serverseitig an Meta – dedupliziert über dieselbe Event-ID wie im Browser."

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:598
msgid "CAPI Access Token"
msgstr "CAPI Access Token"

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:599
msgid "Meta Events Manager → Data sources → Settings → Conversions API → “Generate access token”."
msgstr "Meta Events Manager → Datenquellen → Einstellungen → Conversions API → „Zugriffstoken generieren“."

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:604
msgid "Secret key. Used exclusively server-side and never rendered in the frontend."
msgstr "Geheimschlüssel. Wird ausschließlich serverseitig verwendet und niemals im Frontend ausgegeben."

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:609
msgid "Test Event Code"
msgstr "Test Event Code"

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:610
msgid "Meta Events Manager → Test events → copy the “Server events code”. Clear it again after testing!"
msgstr "Meta Events Manager → Test-Events → „Code für Server-Events“ kopieren. Nach dem Testen wieder leeren!"

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:616
msgid "The test code is automatically deactivated after 12 hours to prevent accidental test tracking on a live site."
msgstr "Der Test-Code wird nach 12 Stunden automatisch deaktiviert, um versehentliches Test-Tracking im Live-Betrieb zu verhindern."

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:620
msgid "Advanced Matching (email)"
msgstr "Advanced Matching (E-Mail)"

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:622
msgid "Enable Advanced Matching"
msgstr "Advanced Matching aktivieren"

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:623
msgid "Sends the email address of logged-in users to the Conversions API as a SHA-256 hash (better match quality). Mind data privacy."
msgstr "Sendet bei eingeloggten Nutzern die E-Mail-Adresse als SHA-256-Hash an die Conversions API (bessere Zuordnungsqualität). Beachte den Datenschutz."

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:629
msgid "Google Ads"
msgstr "Google Ads"

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:629
msgid "Enable Google Ads tracking"
msgstr "Google Ads Tracking aktivieren"

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:633
msgid "Google Tag ID"
msgstr "Google Tag ID"

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:634
msgid "Google Ads → Tools & Settings → Google Tag → copy the ID (AW-XXXXX)."
msgstr "Google Ads → Tools & Einstellungen → Google-Tag → ID kopieren (AW-XXXXX)."

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:643
msgid "Google Consent Mode v2 (default)"
msgstr "Google Consent Mode v2 (Standard)"

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:645
msgid "Enable Google Consent Mode v2 defaults"
msgstr "Google Consent Mode v2 Defaults aktivieren"

#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:646
msgid "Sets ad_storage, ad_user_data, ad_personalization and analytics_storage to \"denied\" by default before the tag loads. Your consent banner then sends the consent update. Recommended for the EU."
msgstr "Setzt ad_storage, ad_user_data, ad_personalization und analytics_storage vor dem Tag-Laden standardmäßig auf „denied“. Dein Consent-Banner sendet anschließend das Consent-Update. Empfohlen für die EU."

